  38: k23(b_s, b_tb_11, b_tb_10, b_sub_11) global 32 local 32: 20 elements (1 group of 32)
  39: reduce_axis_max_float(b_sub_11, b_maxr_10, 4, 5, 1) global 4 local 4: %maxr_10: max along axis 2: 4 lines of 5, one work-item each
  40: table39(b_maxr_10, b_b_12, b_tb_12) global 32 local 32: %tb_12: left table, 4 by 5 items
